## Reporting bugs and requesting features

You can open an issue on GitHub to report bugs or request new {{ project_slug }} features.
Follow these links to submit your issue:

- [Report bugs or other problems while running {{ project_slug }}]({{ github_url }}/issues/new?template=BUG-REPORT.yml).
  If reporting an error, please include a full traceback in your issue.

- [Request features that {{ project_slug }} does not already include]({{ github_url }}/issues/new?template=FEATURE-REQUEST.yml).

- [Report missing or inconsistent information in our documentation]({{ github_url }}/issues/new?template=DOCS.yml).

- [Any other issue]({{ github_url }}/issues/new).

## Submitting changes

Look at the [development guide in our documentation](https://{{ repository_owner }}.github.io/{{ project_slug }}/contributing) for information on how to get set up for development.

